# Shark Typhoon: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, create an X/X blue Shark creature token with flying, where X is
# that spell's mana value." Mind Twist with X = 1 has mana value 2 (CR 107.3a, 202.3e), not its printed 1, so the Shark is
# 2/2. A mana value 0 spell (Mox Ruby) makes a 0/0 that dies (CR 704.5f); a creature spell (Faerie Miscreant) and
# Bot2's noncreature spell (Brainstorm) make nothing. The Typhoon itself and the Moxen before it trigger nothing.

